  "sequence": [
    "Validate the exact outer and inner SHA, live disabled configuration, unchanged 15 code hashes, approved source ancestry and actual deadline; preserve original c/a/b and build records. Source identity checks do not refresh fact times.",
    "After approval only, copy the exact prepared review to the named repository config, validate locally, commit/push this data-only activation on main. Dispatch the reviewed workflow once using the inner review SHA. Bind the returned/uniquely identified actual run to its source, actor, attempt and time. Unknown dispatch stops, no second POST.",
    "Prompt the user only after the exact run environment gate is ready. User personally approves this one publication; no Web approval, no bypass and no Re-run.",
    "The existing protected job verifies that approval, uses only the installed publisher role and fixed build-read token, downloads/revalidates exact A once, rejects occupied tag/conditional audit slot, then performs at most one A Docker push and actual raw ECR manifest verification. B is not pushed.",
    "Read the exact run's small proof artifact once, then as Source independently fetch at most two acknowledged exact S3 versions (published result and intent), verify body SHA/run/source/inner SHA/candidate and derived request ID. Recompute release A using verifyPublishedRelease from authenticated raw manifests; this is not a new live ECR read.",
    "Derive the private BootstrapCatalogInput from that authentic result and the exact originally sealed B. Invoke existing prepare-bootstrap to derive its strict internal registration SHA and register-bootstrap once under this outer delegated approval; no second chat approval is required if every deterministic field and limit matches.",
    "One owner config read, one TLS writer for at most two separate A/B immutable INSERT transactions, close writer, one new TLS connection independently inspects attempted rows. A error/unknown ACK blocks B. Registration/inspection failure retains receipts and stops; no retry, correction or cleanup.",
    "Once the accurate run is terminal (or dispatch certainly never occurred), close only this bootstrap review to the original disabled value in one data-only main commit/push. This is not cloud cleanup or daily runtime activation. Preserve actual outcomes, incomplete states and all permanent slots."
  ],
